##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# Spec 026 Situations scene (tests/shading_contract): row 2: REYES points (0-D); camerahitmode is ignored
version 3.03
Hider "hidden"
Option "shaderformat" "default" ["rslo"]
Option "sampling" "sampler" ["sobol"]
Option "sampling" "seed" [1]
Option "limits" "numthreads" [1]
PixelSamples 1 1
Format 8 8 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" 30
Clipping 0.1 100
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
  Attribute "shade" "string camerahitmode" ["primitive"]
  AttributeBegin
    Surface "sit_marker"
    Points "P" [0 0 0  0.3 0.2 0  -0.3 -0.2 0] "constantwidth" [0.4]
  AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
